    "code": null,
    "label": "Sales"
   },
   {
    "id": "tt_intro",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     0,
     680
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "## Totals and groups\n\nEvery table on the right is a **Show Table** fed from **Sales**. Click one and look at its Properties: **Total row**, **Total row at**, **Show as ▸ grouped**, **Group by**, **Subtotals** and **Totals in output**, plus the rules in **Conditional formatting**.\n\nPress **Rules…** to see the same lines in the builder — the **Totals & groups** page, and **Text colour** / **Draw on** on the Highlight page.\n\nOpen the **Dashboard** and **Report** tabs to see the same tables on a page and on paper.",
     "width": 460,
     "height": 360
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "tt_total",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
    "pos": [
     700,
     0
    ],
    "params": {
     "totals": "sum",
     "format_rules": "Revenue  format $,.0f\nProfit   format $,.0f\nRevenue  bar blue\nUnits    total average\nProduct  total distinct\nRegion   total \"All regions\"\nProfit < 0 => fg red\nProfit < 0 => fg red, icon ▼ red right, on total\nProfit > 0 => fg green, on total",
     "width": 680,
     "height": 420
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "1 · A total row"
   },
   {
    "id": "tt_total_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     1620,
     0
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "**1 · A total row.** *Total row ▸ sum* totals every number column. The rules box refines it a column at a time:\n\n- `Units total average` — one column averaged instead\n- `Product total distinct` — how many different products\n- `Region total \"All regions\"` — words instead of a number\n\nClick a header: the rows sort, the total stays at the bottom. The data bar ignores the total (it would always be the longest), and `on total` gives the total its own colour and ▼.",
     "width": 520,
     "height": 260
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "tt_both",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
    "pos": [
     700,
     580
    ],
    "params": {
     "totals": "average",
     "totals_at": "both",
     "total_label": "Average",
     "format_rules": "Revenue  format $,.0f\nProfit   format $,.2f\nUnits    total max\ntotal => bg #2a3550, bold",
     "width": 680,
     "height": 420
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "2 · Top and bottom, styled"
   },
   {
    "id": "tt_both_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     1620,
     580
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "**2 · Top and bottom.** *Total row at ▸ both*, *Total label ▸ Average*, and `Units total max` for the one column where the biggest order is the interesting number.\n\n`total => bg #2a3550, bold` restyles the total rows. `subtotal => …` and `group => …` do the same for a grouped table.",
     "width": 520,
     "height": 180
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "tt_grouped",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
    "pos": [
     700,
     1160
    ],
    "params": {
     "mode": "grouped",
     "group_by": "Region",
     "totals": "sum",
     "subtotals": "on the group row",
     "format_rules": "Revenue  format $,.0f\nProfit   format $,.0f\nRevenue  bar blue\nProfit < 0 => fg red, icon ▼ red right, on all\nProfit > 0 => fg green, on totals",
     "width": 680,
     "height": 520
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "3 · Grouped by region"
   },
   {
    "id": "tt_grouped_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     1620,
     1160
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "**3 · Grouped.** *Show as ▸ grouped*, *Group by ▸ Region*: each region gets a header row with its row count and subtotals. **Click a region to fold it**; right-click for Expand / Collapse All Groups.\n\n`on all` puts the red ▼ on negative data rows *and* totals; `on totals` greens the positive subtotals and the grand total without touching the rows.",
     "width": 520,
     "height": 220
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "tt_nested",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
    "pos": [
     700,
     1840
    ],
    "params": {
     "mode": "grouped",
     "group_by": "Region, Product",
     "groups_start": "outer level open",
     "subtotals": "both",
     "totals": "sum",
     "totals_at": "top",
     "total_label": "All sales",
     "format_rules": "Revenue  format $,.0f\nProfit   format $,.0f\nsubtotal both \"subtotal\"\ngroup => bg #26343f\nProfit < 0 => fg red, on subtotals",
     "width": 680,
     "height": 460
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "4 · Nested, starts folded"
   },
   {
    "id": "tt_nested_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     1620,
     1840
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "**4 · Nested.** *Group by ▸ Region, Product* nests, outermost first. *Groups start ▸ outer level open* shows each region's products folded — click one to see its rows.\n\n*Subtotals ▸ both* writes them on the group row and under the group; `subtotal both \"subtotal\"` changes what follows the name. The grand total is at the top, called *All sales*.",
     "width": 520,
     "height": 200
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "tt_out",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
    "pos": [
